---Properties referring a single dimension (either row or column). If both BandedRange.row_properties and BandedRange.column_properties are set, the fill colors are applied to cells according to the following rules: * header_color and footer_color take priority over band colors. * first_band_color takes priority over second_band_color. * row_properties takes priority over column_properties. For example, the first row color takes priority over the first column color, but the first column color takes priority over the second row color. Similarly, the row header takes priority over the column header in the top left cell, but the column header takes priority over the first row color if the row header is not set.
---@class gcp.sheets_v4.BandingProperties
---@field headerColor? gcp.sheets_v4.Color The color of the first row or column. If this field is set, the first row or column is filled with this color and the colors alternate between first_band_color and second_band_color starting from the second row or column. Otherwise, the first row or column is filled with first_band_color and the colors proceed to alternate as they normally would. Deprecated: Use header_color_style.
---@field headerColorStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.ColorStyle The color of the first row or column. If this field is set, the first row or column is filled with this color and the colors alternate between first_band_color and second_band_color starting from the second row or column. Otherwise, the first row or column is filled with first_band_color and the colors proceed to alternate as they normally would. If header_color is also set, this field takes precedence.
---@field firstBandColorStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.ColorStyle The first color that is alternating. (Required) If first_band_color is also set, this field takes precedence.
---@field firstBandColor? gcp.sheets_v4.Color The first color that is alternating. (Required) Deprecated: Use first_band_color_style.
---@field footerColorStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.ColorStyle The color of the last row or column. If this field is not set, the last row or column is filled with either first_band_color or second_band_color, depending on the color of the previous row or column. If footer_color is also set, this field takes precedence.
---@field footerColor? gcp.sheets_v4.Color The color of the last row or column. If this field is not set, the last row or column is filled with either first_band_color or second_band_color, depending on the color of the previous row or column. Deprecated: Use footer_color_style.
---@field secondBandColorStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.ColorStyle The second color that is alternating. (Required) If second_band_color is also set, this field takes precedence.
---@field secondBandColor? gcp.sheets_v4.Color The second color that is alternating. (Required) Deprecated: Use second_band_color_style.

