---A bubble chart.
---@class gcp.sheets_v4.BubbleChartSpec
---@field bubbleOpacity? number The opacity of the bubbles between 0 and 1.0. 0 is fully transparent and 1 is fully opaque.
---@field bubbleBorderColor? gcp.sheets_v4.Color The bubble border color. Deprecated: Use bubble_border_color_style.
---@field domain? gcp.sheets_v4.ChartData The data containing the bubble x-values. These values locate the bubbles in the chart horizontally.
---@field bubbleMinRadiusSize? number The minimum radius size of the bubbles, in pixels. If specific, the field must be a positive value.
---@field bubbleMaxRadiusSize? number The max radius size of the bubbles, in pixels. If specified, the field must be a positive value.
---@field bubbleTextStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.TextFormat The format of the text inside the bubbles. Strikethrough, underline, and link are not supported.
---@field groupIds? gcp.sheets_v4.ChartData The data containing the bubble group IDs. All bubbles with the same group ID are drawn in the same color. If bubble_sizes is specified then this field must also be specified but may contain blank values. This field is optional.
---@field bubbleLabels? gcp.sheets_v4.ChartData The data containing the bubble labels. These do not need to be unique.
---@field bubbleBorderColorStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.ColorStyle The bubble border color. If bubble_border_color is also set, this field takes precedence.
---@field series? gcp.sheets_v4.ChartData The data containing the bubble y-values. These values locate the bubbles in the chart vertically.
---@field bubbleSizes? gcp.sheets_v4.ChartData The data containing the bubble sizes. Bubble sizes are used to draw the bubbles at different sizes relative to each other. If specified, group_ids must also be specified. This field is optional.
---@field legendPosition? gcp.sheets_v4.BubbleChartSpecLegendPositionEnum|string Where the legend of the chart should be drawn.

