---@field domain? gcp.sheets_v4.CandlestickDomain The domain data (horizontal axis) for the candlestick chart. String data will be treated as discrete labels, other data will be treated as continuous values.

---The Candlestick chart data, each containing the low, open, close, and high values for a series.
---@class gcp.sheets_v4.CandlestickData
---@field lowSeries? gcp.sheets_v4.CandlestickSeries The range data (vertical axis) for the low/minimum value for each candle. This is the bottom of the candle's center line.
---@field closeSeries? gcp.sheets_v4.CandlestickSeries The range data (vertical axis) for the close/final value for each candle. This is the top of the candle body. If greater than the open value the candle will be filled. Otherwise the candle will be hollow.
---@field openSeries? gcp.sheets_v4.CandlestickSeries The range data (vertical axis) for the open/initial value for each candle. This is the bottom of the candle body. If less than the close value the candle will be filled. Otherwise the candle will be hollow.
