---Properties of a sheet.
---@class gcp.sheets_v4.SheetProperties
---@field tabColor? gcp.sheets_v4.Color The color of the tab in the UI. Deprecated: Use tab_color_style.
---@field sheetId? number The ID of the sheet. Must be non-negative. This field cannot be changed once set.
---@field dataSourceSheetProperties? gcp.sheets_v4.DataSourceSheetProperties Output only. If present, the field contains DATA_SOURCE sheet specific properties.
---@field title? string The name of the sheet.
---@field tabColorStyle? gcp.sheets_v4.ColorStyle The color of the tab in the UI. If tab_color is also set, this field takes precedence.
---@field hidden? boolean True if the sheet is hidden in the UI, false if it's visible.
---@field sheetType? gcp.sheets_v4.SheetPropertiesSheetTypeEnum|string The type of sheet. Defaults to GRID. This field cannot be changed once set.
---@field rightToLeft? boolean True if the sheet is an RTL sheet instead of an LTR sheet.
---@field gridProperties? gcp.sheets_v4.GridProperties Additional properties of the sheet if this sheet is a grid. (If the sheet is an object sheet, containing a chart or image, then this field will be absent.) When writing it is an error to set any grid properties on non-grid sheets. If this sheet is a DATA_SOURCE sheet, this field is output only but contains the properties that reflect how a data source sheet is rendered in the UI, e.g. row_count.
---@field index? number The index of the sheet within the spreadsheet. When adding or updating sheet properties, if this field is excluded then the sheet is added or moved to the end of the sheet list. When updating sheet indices or inserting sheets, movement is considered in "before the move" indexes. For example, if there were three sheets (S1, S2, S3) in order to move S1 ahead of S2 the index would have to be set to 2. A sheet index update request is ignored if the requested index is identical to the sheets current index or if the requested new index is equal to the current sheet index + 1.

---@alias gcp.sheets_v4.SheetPropertiesSheetTypeEnum "SHEET_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"GRID"|"OBJECT"|"DATA_SOURCE"

