---@field customSubtotals? gcp.sheets_v4.WaterfallChartCustomSubtotalList Custom subtotal columns appearing in this series. The order in which subtotals are defined is not significant. Only one subtotal may be defined for each data point.

---@alias gcp.sheets_v4.WaterfallChartSeriesList gcp.sheets_v4.WaterfallChartSeries[]

---A waterfall chart.
---@class gcp.sheets_v4.WaterfallChartSpec
