---@field firstValueIsTotal? boolean True to interpret the first value as a total.
---@field series? gcp.sheets_v4.WaterfallChartSeriesList The data this waterfall chart is visualizing.
---@field hideConnectorLines? boolean True to hide connector lines between columns.
